WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.990
Here are the nominees for
Performance by an Actor

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.550
in a Supporting Role.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.780
When I heard my name called,
for the first time in my life

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.660
I kind of felt like time
stopped for a moment.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.150
I felt like I was
in this like vortex.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.290
Mahershala Ali, Moonlight.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:29.860
This is the first Oscar and
nomination for Mahershala Ali.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.930
It was one of the most special
things I've ever experienced.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.160
Just to see so many people out
there that I admire and love

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.470
and appreciate and
am inspired by,

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:45.332
by clapping for me
and for our film.

00:00:45.332 --> 00:00:46.790
I still can get
choked up about it.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.040
So yeah, I'm a little
speechless now.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.360
This is how I felt, speechless.

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:55.520
Wow.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.280
I managed to find
some words to say.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.360
I just want to thank my wife
who was in her third trimester

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.800
during awards season.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:08.090
We just had our
daughter four days ago.

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:10.370
Don't get pregnant
during awards season

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.980
and don't get your partner
pregnant during awards season.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:16.800
It's already crazy so you don't
want to add babies to that.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.040
I just want to thank
her for being just such

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.220
a soldier through this process
and help in really carrying me

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:24.020
through it all so, thank you.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.460
Really appreciate it.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.900
Peace and blessings.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.190
I was amazed and
in awe of it all.

